  "text": "Concern regarding intake form data visibility\n\nHello, I am writing because something very strange happened with our digital intake forms this morning and I am quite worried about patient privacy. A patient came in and mentioned that when they were filling out their medical history questionnaire online last night, part of the previous person's emergency contact details seemed to flash on their screen before their own form loaded. We use custom intake forms that we published to our portal link, and I don't know if this means records are getting crossed or if data was visible to someone who shouldn't see it. Could you please look into how our form field validation and session caching are working right now? We want to make sure no confidential information was exposed."
 },
